{"id": "EUVD-2026-97628", "enisaUuid": "cd61d275-7032-34e5-a457-0f94c45a051a", "description": "Grav before 2.1.7 contains an information disclosure vulnerability because bundled nginx, lighttpd, IIS, and Caddy 2 configurations block .git only at document root. Unauthenticated attackers can request nested repositories such as user/.git to retrieve Git config, refs, and objects, reconstructing unpublished history or committed secrets.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T12:13:29", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/getgrav/grav/security/advisories/GHSA-5vx9-x8f2-f55w", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/grav-before-2.1.7-information-disclosure-via-nested-git-directories"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109326", "GHSA-7mh9-rw55-r7vq"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7b6d4f89-be5e-32fe-84b6-e27f1806958e", "product": {"name": "grav", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.1.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c8e2e754-3b0b-3b85-b207-693c99b76d0a", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}], "isExploited": false}